WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:09.640
In this class, you have taken your first steps into the wonderful world of photogrammetry and how to turn 2D pictures into 3D models.

2
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:28.219
You learned about how to set the stage and take pictures properly, what hardware to use for an efficient photoshoot, you learned about the limitations that are inherent with surface properties, and heard about several software choices that are available to you.

3
00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:38.520
You learned about the pros and cons of using photogrammetry with a smartphone versus the professional way of using a more robust desktop application.

4
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:43.060
I hope you have enjoyed this class and hope to see you again very soon.
